{"page":107,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:3","surah":5,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"حُرِّمَتْ عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلْمَيْتَةُ وَٱلدَّمُ وَلَحْمُ ٱلْخِنزِيرِ وَمَآ أُهِلَّ لِغَيْرِ ٱللَّهِ بِهِۦ وَٱلْمُنْخَنِقَةُ وَٱلْمَوْقُوذَةُ وَٱلْمُتَرَدِّيَةُ وَٱلنَّطِيحَةُ وَمَآ أَكَلَ ٱلسَّبُعُ إِلَّا مَا ذَكَّيْتُمْ وَمَا ذُبِحَ عَلَى ٱلنُّصُبِ وَأَن تَسْتَقْسِمُوا۟ بِٱلْأَزْلَـٰمِ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ فِسْقٌ ۗ ٱلْيَوْمَ يَئِسَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِن دِينِكُمْ فَلَا تَخْشَوْهُمْ وَٱخْشَوْنِ ۚ ٱلْيَوْمَ أَكْمَلْتُ لَكُمْ دِينَكُمْ وَأَتْمَمْتُ عَلَيْكُمْ نِعْمَتِى وَرَضِيتُ لَكُمُ ٱلْإِسْلَـٰمَ دِينًا ۚ فَمَنِ ٱضْطُرَّ فِى مَخْمَصَةٍ غَيْرَ مُتَجَانِفٍ لِّإِثْمٍ ۙ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You are forbidden to eat carrion; blood; pig’s meat; any animal over which any name other than God’s has been invoked; any animal strangled, or victim of a violent blow or a fall, or gored or savaged by a beast of prey, unless you still slaughter it [in the correct manner]; or anything sacrificed on idolatrous altars. You are also forbidden to allot shares [of meat] by drawing marked arrows -a heinous practice- today the disbelievers have lost all hope that you will give up your religion. Do not fear them: fear Me. Today I have perfected your religion for you, completed My blessing upon you, and chosen as your religion islam: [total devotion to God]; but if any of you is forced by hunger to eat forbidden food, with no intention of doing wrong, then God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"حُرِّمَتْ","en_gloss":"Are made unlawful","transliteration":"ḥurrimat","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمُ","en_gloss":"on you","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمَيْتَةُ","en_gloss":"the dead animals","transliteration":"l-maytatu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلدَّمُ","en_gloss":"and the blood","transliteration":"wal-damu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَحْمُ","en_gloss":"and flesh","transliteration":"walaḥmu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْخِنزِيرِ","en_gloss":"(of) the swine","transliteration":"l-khinzīri","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُهِلَّ","en_gloss":"has been dedicated","transliteration":"uhilla","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"to other than","transliteration":"lighayri","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"[on it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلْمُنْخَنِقَةُ","en_gloss":"and that which is strangled (to death)","transliteration":"wal-mun'khaniqatu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَٱلْمَوْقُوذَةُ","en_gloss":"and that which is hit fatally","transliteration":"wal-mawqūdhatu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱلْمُتَرَدِّيَةُ","en_gloss":"and that which has a fatal fall","transliteration":"wal-mutaradiyatu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱلنَّطِيحَةُ","en_gloss":"and that which is gored by horns","transliteration":"wal-naṭīḥatu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and that which","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَكَلَ","en_gloss":"ate (it)","transliteration":"akala","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلسَّبُعُ","en_gloss":"the wild animal","transliteration":"l-sabuʿu","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":19,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ذَكَّيْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you slaughtered","transliteration":"dhakkaytum","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ذُبِحَ","en_gloss":"is sacrificed","transliteration":"dhubiḥa","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":24,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"5:3"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱلنُّصُبِ","en_glos